# Google Maps JavaScript API key, used by ServiceAreaMap.astro's "Where we
# work" section. Get one at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis
# — enable the "Maps JavaScript API", then restrict the key to your domain(s)
# under "API restrictions" / "Application restrictions" (HTTP referrers).
# Must be PUBLIC_-prefixed so Astro/Vite exposes it to client-side code.
#
# Without a key set, ServiceAreaMap.astro falls back to a stylized SVG map
# instead — the site still works fine with this left blank.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
